{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-5d7d605ba6aa1003b5e3","statement":"<<ref:lemma-existence-of-the-weight>>.\nThen $\\lm(\\gamma a)=\\lm(\\gamma)\\lt(a).$ Following Lemma","source_id":"arXiv:0801.0903","cluster":"algebra","statement_sha256":"f1793d719f8e749c9781ede51a31260d7febd7ac48323da26514309fc1507e54","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 4","ref_key":"","name":"","order":18,"deps":[{"ref":"lemma-existence-of-the-weight","card_id":null,"label":null,"resolved":false,"target":"statement"}],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.0903","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"09813b733a4f28cb5b4f88900b69c8f60bc9633d35e93f677ba385ca58a5a18d","line":1811,"origin":"latex_heading","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:01:36+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":94,"math_hints":8}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:0801.0903","title":"GELFAND-KIRILLOV CONJECTURE [0.4em] AND GELFAND-TSETLIN MODULES FOR [0.4em] FINITE $W$-ALGEBRAS","abstract":"We address two problems regarding the structure and representation theory of finite W-algebras associated with the general linear Lie algebras. Finite W-algebras can be defined either via the Whittaker model of Kostant or, equivalently, by the quantum Hamiltonian reduction. Our first main result is a proof of the Gelfand-Kirillov conjecture for the skew fields of fractions of the finite W-algebras. The second main result is a parametrization of finite families of irreducible Harish-Chandra modules by the characters of the Gelfand-Tsetlin subalgebra. As a corollary, we obtain a complete classification of generic irreducible Harish-Chandra modules for the finite W-algebras.","authors":["Vyacheslav Futorny","Alexander Molev","Serge Ovsienko"],"year":"2008","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.0903","cluster":"algebra","macros":{"non":"\\nonumber","wt":"\\widetilde","la":"\\lambda","ga